    }

    // Gen-31 mutation: dual-item chain feasibility — reward placements that
    // leave a residual the next item can consume while ALSO keeping the
    // resulting gap small enough to be re-sealed by a typical small item,
    // compounding lookahead with fine-grained fitting.
